# Quatricmorph core

- Canonical implementation architecture: root `ARCHITECTURE.md` (immutable SoT). Short form: `docs/PRODUCT_BRIEF.md`.
- Broader product vision: `docs/PRODUCT_ARCHITECTURE_v1.md` — subordinate where it conflicts with `ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Active coding track by default: Phase 0 Tensor Tiling Spike (`docs/requirements/VIZ_MVP.md`, `TILE-*`).
- Treat `mm/` as read-only historical reference. Do not delete it. Do not treat legacy `quatricmorph/` Three.js as the architecture target.
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agent/CHARTER.md`.
- Check `docs/requirements/PREREQUISITES.md` before large features.
- Axioms: validate before success; no semantic claims without evidence; local-first; visualization backed by shared query/math substrate; distinguish exact/sampled/approximate.
- Prefer small diffs. New platform code follows architecture §16 (`crates/`, `apps/`, `architectures/`, `schemas/`).
- Obey architecture §19 (no cube-per-weight GLBs; Cesium is not compute; no full-tensor browser dumps).
